From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.invalid>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 20:19:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(download): publish caller filenames without
 clobbering

Use an atomic same-directory hard link; collisions and unsupported filesystems fail without another download or an unsafe rename fallback. Preserve replacement for default MD5 names and cover deterministic concurrent publication.
